              "tag": "td",
              "attrs": [],
              "html": "rollback_semantics Returned if CleanUpPersistency, or ResetPersistency is currently being executed, or if RecoverKeyValueStorage or ResetKeyValue Storage is currently being executed for the same Key-Value Storage. Also, while UpdatePersistency is currently being executed, this error is returned when OpenKeyValueStorage is called outside of the callback registered via RegisterApplicationDataUpdate Callback, or if the used InstanceSpecifier differs from the one provided by the callback."
